<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aludie raises half yr shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Aludie raises half yr shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     1.31	  vs   0.45</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs    -</p>
<p>Retained income at</p>
<p>    end of period	   1.90	  vs   1.62</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.18	  vs   0.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		  2.66	  vs   2.33</p>
<p>    Full name:   Aludie Limited (developmnet capital market)</p>
<p>NOTE - The board of directors has decided not to recommend an interim dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
